    kind: work_item  # 893f
    title: "A library-signature catalogue (producing function -> returned type): 820 method-kind io rows across 9 languages need a typed receiver, and receivers from library return values cannot be typed from analysed source at all"  # 893f
    status: todo_hard  # 893f
    priority: 2  # 893f
    parent:  # 893f
    tags:  # 893f
    - io_boundary  # 893f
